    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Awaiting the stamp of a new owner. 13 The Drive comes to the market offering the new owner a blank canvas to upgrade and improve this lovely bright and spacious family home which whilst dated is presented in very good condition. Situated in a quiet position in Boden Park, close to an open green area, the property offers a generous size of c.100 sq.m complimented by a lovely sunny rear garden of c.11m in depth with a gated side access. The property also has an enclosed front garden and good off street parking. Heating is by way of an oil fired boiler.\r\nBoden Park is understandably a firm favourite with families. Its great location off Scholarstown Rd offers an excellent range of primary and secondary schools nearby together with an abundance of sports facilities and good retail options. The area has excellent transport links including numerous bus routes and ready access to the M50. Viewing is by appointment with David Lorigan."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation comprises an entrance hall, large living room/ dining room with open fireplace, kitchen/ breakfast room, 3 bedrooms and a family bathroom"
      },
